1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,549
Collagen cream does not
replace your collagen.

2
00:00:02,769 --> 00:00:05,747
Collagen powder does not travel
straight to your face.

3
00:00:06,097 --> 00:00:07,466
So where does it go?

4
00:00:07,686 --> 00:00:10,049
23 trials say the powder works.

5
00:00:10,269 --> 00:00:12,049
Remove the industry funded ones,

6
00:00:12,049 --> 00:00:13,384
and watch what happens.

7
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:16,685
But first, what protects the
collagen you already have?

8
00:00:17,035 --> 00:00:19,149
Think of your skin
as a building.

9
00:00:19,369 --> 00:00:21,760
Collagen is the main
structure inside it.

10
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,094
It keeps everything firm and upright.

11
00:00:24,394 --> 00:00:26,346
As we age, collagen production slows.

12
00:00:26,566 --> 00:00:30,013
And ultraviolet light switches on
enzymes that cut collagen apart.

13
00:00:30,233 --> 00:00:33,218
The sun runs a demolition
crew. It works weekends.

14
00:00:33,518 --> 00:00:35,462
Sunscreen is not just about sunburn.

15
00:00:35,682 --> 00:00:37,886
It draws a boundary
around the building.

16
00:00:38,106 --> 00:00:41,282
Preserving collagen is usually easier
than replacing it later.

17
00:00:41,632 --> 00:00:42,632
Now, the cream.

18
00:00:42,735 --> 00:00:46,263
To pass through skin, a molecule
generally needs to be under

19
00:00:46,263 --> 00:00:47,722
about 500 daltons.

20
00:00:47,942 --> 00:00:50,182
Collagen is around 300,000.

21
00:00:50,402 --> 00:00:52,574
It is not getting
through that door.

22
00:00:52,874 --> 00:00:56,104
It may still form a
moisturising film on the surface.

23
00:00:56,324 --> 00:00:57,679
Skin may feel smoother.

24
00:00:57,899 --> 00:01:00,991
But polishing the windows is
not replacing the beams.

25
00:01:01,341 --> 00:01:02,341
Now, the powder.

26
00:01:02,441 --> 00:01:06,187
Swallow collagen, and digestion breaks it
into peptides and amino acids.

27
00:01:06,407 --> 00:01:08,753
Your stomach does not
offer facial delivery.

28
00:01:09,053 --> 00:01:10,659
Some pieces may be absorbed.

29
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:13,187
Certain peptides may even
act as signals.

30
00:01:13,407 --> 00:01:15,548
But your body decides
where they go.

31
00:01:15,768 --> 00:01:18,612
Skin, joints, tendons, wherever
repairs are most urgent.

32
00:01:18,832 --> 00:01:20,371
Your face ordered scaffolding.

33
00:01:20,591 --> 00:01:22,465
It got a box
of spare parts.

34
00:01:23,015 --> 00:01:24,179
Does the powder work?

35
00:01:24,399 --> 00:01:26,854
Trials do report modest
improvements in hydration,

36
00:01:26,854 --> 00:01:27,956
elasticity, or wrinkles.

37
00:01:28,256 --> 00:01:29,921
But many were small, short,

38
00:01:29,921 --> 00:01:31,079
and industry funded.

39
00:01:31,379 --> 00:01:34,870
In 2025, researchers pooled
23 randomised trials.

40
00:01:35,090 --> 00:01:36,306
All together, a benefit.

41
00:01:36,526 --> 00:01:38,863
Keep only the studies
without industry funding,

42
00:01:38,863 --> 00:01:41,169
and it is no
longer statistically significant.

43
00:01:41,389 --> 00:01:44,134
Keep only the higher
quality studies. Same result.

44
00:01:44,354 --> 00:01:45,850
The effect stops showing up.

45
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:47,508
Do supplements definitely work?

46
00:01:47,728 --> 00:01:49,654
We cannot say that. Definitely fail?

47
00:01:49,874 --> 00:01:51,665
We cannot confidently say that either.

48
00:01:51,885 --> 00:01:53,562
The independent evidence is uncertain.

49
00:01:54,112 --> 00:01:55,746
What the evidence actually supports.

50
00:01:55,966 --> 00:01:58,375
Broad spectrum sunscreen, every
day. Not smoking.

51
00:01:58,595 --> 00:02:00,025
Enough protein and vitamin C.

52
00:02:00,245 --> 00:02:03,894
And for suitable users, topical retinoids
have considerably stronger evidence for

53
00:02:03,894 --> 00:02:06,112
encouraging collagen production than collagen cream.

54
00:02:06,412 --> 00:02:08,659
Collagen cream can be
a pleasant moisturiser.

55
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:10,234
Collagen powder is optional.

56
00:02:10,454 --> 00:02:13,471
Protect the building before you
buy expensive powdered bricks.
